    "contentHtml": "<p>What an incredible night! Our 10th Annual Campos Community Christmas Tree Lighting was truly magical thanks to you, our wonderful community. Families, friends, neighbors, and alumni came together to celebrate the start of the holiday season, and we couldn’t be more grateful.</p>\n<p>From the moment parking opened and guests began to arrive, the excitement was in the air. DJ Precaution filled the evening with festive music, our food trucks Smashed Broz Burgers, Tacos el Asador, and Speakeasy Baking Co kept everyone happily fed, and the complimentary face painting brought smiles to kids (and adults!) of all ages.</p>\n<p>Of course, the big highlight of the night was watching the beautiful Christmas tree come to life as we lit it together. Thank you to everyone who joined in the countdown and helped make that moment unforgettable.</p>\n<p>Santa was busy greeting families all evening, and we loved seeing all the joy in this year’s photos.</p>\n<p><strong>View and Download Your Event Photos</strong></p>\n<p>Relive the night and download your favorite memories.<br />\nClick the link below to view the full photo gallery:</p>\n<p><strong>Gallery:</strong> <a href=\"https://cynthiairene.smugmug.com/Campos-Tree-Lighting-2025\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://cynthiairene.smugmug.com/Campos-Tree-Lighting-2025</a></p>\n<p><strong>Download Password:</strong> CAMPOS</p>"
