    "formattedDate": "November 20, 2023",
    "category": "Events",
    "excerpt": "Get ready to kick off the holiday season in style at Campos Family Vineyards! Christmas is just around the corner, and the vineyard is buzzing with festive activities for everyone to enjoy. From the 8th annual Holiday Sip and Shop on November 25th to the enchanting Community Christmas Tree Lighting on December 1st, there&#8217;s no shortage of joy and cheer. It’s the most wonderful time of the year, and we’re excited to celebrate with ...",
    "image": "https://camposfamilyvineyards.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Christmas-at-Campos-Family-Vineyards.png",
    "contentHtml": "<p>Get ready to kick off the holiday season in style at Campos Family Vineyards!</p>\n<p>Christmas is just around the corner, and the vineyard is buzzing with festive activities for everyone to enjoy. From the 8th annual Holiday Sip and Shop on November 25th to the enchanting Community Christmas Tree Lighting on December 1st, there&#8217;s no shortage of joy and cheer.</p>\n<p>It’s the most wonderful time of the year, and we’re excited to celebrate with you!</p>\n<h3><strong>VINEYARD EVENTS</strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://camposfamilyvineyards.com/wp-event/annual-holiday-sip-and-shop-at-campos-family-vineyards-2/\"><strong>Annual Holiday Sip and Shop</strong></a></span><br />\nNOVEMBER 25 | 12-5 PM<br />\nWe’re excited to bring you our Holiday Sip &amp; Shop for the 8th year in a row!<br />\nThe Saturday after Thanksgiving, leave the leftovers at home, grab your family or your favorite shopping buddy and spend the day with us!<br />\nWe’ll have a DJ, food trucks, and 40+ amazing local vendors.<br />\nYou’re guaranteed to find unique, locally-made gifts for everyone on your list this year (including yourself!). Trust us, this is an event you don’t want to miss.</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://camposfamilyvineyards.com/wp-event/campos-community-christmas-tree-lighting/\"><strong>Campos Community Christmas Tree Lighting</strong></a></span><br />\nDECEMBER 1 | 6 PM<br />\n(Sold out!)<br />\nJoin us for the Annual Campos Community Christmas Tree Lighting! Get into the festive spirit as we come together to celebrate the holiday season.<br />\nBring your family and friends along for an evening of joy, laughter, and holiday cheer. There will be live music by Steve Hanson and Friends, delicious food trucks, and fun activities for all ages.<br />\nDidn’t get your tickets this time around? Wine Club Members get priority access to event ticket sales, along with many more perks. Click here to learn more about becoming a Member.</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://camposfamilyvineyards.com/wp-event/live-music-with-toree-mcgee/\"><strong>Live Music With Toree McGee</strong></a></span><br />\nDECEMBER 9 | 12:30-4:30 PM<br />\nJoin us for this family-friendly day of great music and award winning wines with the beautiful and talented local favorite, Toree McGee!<br />\nBring your whole family (no pets please) and enjoy the afternoon with us! We will be indoors for this event, so no chairs or blankets are needed.</p>\n<h3><strong>THROUGHOUT THE SEASON…</strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Czb3V2dvILq/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Thanksgiving Bundle Sale</strong></a></span><br />\nNOVEMBER 1-30<br />\n<a href=\"https://camposfamilywines.com/products/layla-rae-chardonnay-oak-aged\">Layla Rae Chardonnay</a>, <a href=\"https://camposfamilywines.com/products/2021-lodi-sangiovese\">Lodi Sangiovese</a>, and <a href=\"https://camposfamilywines.com/products/2016-mourvedre\">Mourvèdre</a>, oh my!<br />\nFor only $100, you can all 3 bottles and be everyone’s favorite guest at Thanksgiving dinner.<br />\nAvailable for purchase in the <a href=\"http://35.91.185.16\">tasting room</a> until the end of November.</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"http://camposfamilywines.com\"><strong>Case Sale</strong></a></span><br />\nNOVEMBER 24-DECEMBER 31</p>\n<p>Stock up on all your favorite Campos wines during our BIGGEST sale of the year!</p>\n<p>Case price starts at $120. When part of a case, bottle prices range from $10-17 each.</p>\n<p>The holiday case sale will run from November 24 (Black Friday) to December 31. Available online and onsite. Free local delivery.</p>\n<p>Purchase online <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"http://camposfamilywines.com\">here</a></span>.</p>\n<p><strong>Tasting Room Gifts</strong><br />\nFrom wine accessories, to our bestselling wines, to luxurious olive oils, <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/CwqpN3YPE17/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">we have something for everybody on your list</a></span> (including yourself!)<br />\nVisit us during our tasting room hours:<br />\nThurs: 1-5 pm<br />\nFri: 1-5 pm<br />\nSat: 12-5 pm<br />\nSun: 1-5 pm</p>\n<p>Want to host your Christmas event with us?</p>\n<p>Our winery’s idyllic location in the San Francisco Bay Area makes Campos Family Vineyards the perfect choice as your next event venue. Whether your group is small and intimate, or you’re putting on a large corporate party, we look forward to hosting your special day and serving you award-winning wines.</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://camposfamilyvineyards.com/private-events/\">See venue options and take a virtual tour here.</a></span></p>"
